        "id": 1035
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-13T01:09:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"visible\" as in \"visible to the client\", as opposed to something like a merge commit which is never announced to the client. The daemon currently doesn\u0027t enforce that the target of a reaction hasn\u0027t been deleted, so the tests shouldn\u0027t do so either.",
      "parentUuid": "40f9d7c2_4efb55b9",
